00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:20.180
Da... d...

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.150
CHAPTER 49

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:37.130
NANASHI AND MANA

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.330
Rat Man...?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.980
Don't give me that "Rat Man...?" crap!

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.670
Stop giving up just because your dad died!

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.610
Don't you get it?

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.560
Well? How's that?

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.260
What was that for?!

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:24.660
Kitaro, didn't that hurt?

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:28.200
Wasn't it so painful
your lungs tightened up?

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:33.230
Did you think about your dad
for even an instant then?

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:38.920
That's grief for you.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:42.740
When it comes to survival,
it ain't worth a hair on your butt.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:47.430
I'm half <i>yokai</i> and half human.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.020
I'm a mongrel
taking shots from both sides.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:55.480
That's why I know
what Nanashi's trying to do.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.380
He believes the world's better off
if both <i>yokai</i> and humans disappear.

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.990
As if doing that would make any profit.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.390
It won't fill your belly.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.880
I'd like to beat up Nanashi if I could.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:19.020
But... I can't!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.300
I don't have that power!

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.570
And yet, look at you!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.600
Rat Man...

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:32.020
Whining like it's the end of the world
just because your dad died.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:35.650
The end of the world? That's it there!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.670
You have the power to stop that,
don't you?!

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.990
There's still so much I wanna do.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.970
I wanna make money
and eat lots of good food.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:51.470
Drive cars around and pamper girls.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:55.460
I wanna swirl brandy
in a high class penthouse.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:05:00.340
I want heaps of roasted pork, boiled eggs,
and bamboo shoots in my ramen!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.750
Stop that thing.
You're the only one who can.

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:27.760
I never thought
I'd get a scolding from you.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.320
Kitaro.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.220
I'll stop Nanashi.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.790
Rollo Cloth!

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:37.000
Right here!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.980
Rat Man, tell everyone
to flee with the humans.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.360
Sure thing!

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:50.220
Wait, why do I have to do something
that won't make any money?

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.270
Kitaro-san!

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:06.340
Finger Guns!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.380
This is...

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.520
<i>It's their fault!</i>

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:40.520
<i>Die!</i>

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:41.770
<i>Kill the </i>yokai<i>!</i>

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.840
<i>Kill the humans!</i>

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.800
<i>The time is 11:50 PM.</i>

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.510
<i>She's gone.</i>

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.280
WOOD

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:09.400
FIRE

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.530
EARTH

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:11.660
METAL

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.430
WATER

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.590
I get it, Nanashi!

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:29.340
This is where you've gathered
all the malice in the world.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:34.090
You focused that malice into letters
that you injected into Mana.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.740
To make her a vessel.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.750
These tricks won't work anymore.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.420
Mana!

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:09.090
I said it won't work!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.380
Internal Electricity!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.790
Mana! Hold on!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:25.830
Mana.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.410
I won't forgive you.

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:44.440
Because of you <i>yokai</i>, my mom...

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.540
My mom...!

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:50.480
Listen to me. Your mother's alive!

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.190
Liar!

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.510
It's true that Catchick hurt your mother.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.910
But that was a trap by Nanashi!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.420
Lies! It has to be a lie!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.130
Cat-san killed my mom!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.020
That's how it must be!

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.510
Because...

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:15.950
I'm the one who annihilated Cat-san!

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.650
Say something!

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.030
Mana.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:41.200
It was all set up by Nanashi.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.640
And your proof?

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.500
I'm asking if you have any proof!

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.280
I don't.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.740
You're saying I should trust what you say?

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.050
That's right.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.150
Don't let hate overcome you.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.770
That's what Dad said.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:13.500
Even if you do annihilate us...

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.630
We won't hate you for it.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.080
Here.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:33.210
<i>If I don't keep my eye on you,
you're likely to get in more trouble.</i>

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.630
<i>Mana.</i>

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.630
NOTSUGO

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:57.130
BIRTH OF KITARO

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.030
<i>"Wobble, wobble."</i>

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:07.140
When Cat-san said
"I'm sorry, Mana" in the end,

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:12.500
I thought she was saying sorry
for hurting my mom.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:18.220
But now I know she also meant
"I'm sorry for making you do this."

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.150
And yet...!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.990
I'm sorry, Cat-san!

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.720
I'm sorry!

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:26.390
I'm sorry!

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.250
Mana.

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:35.190
I can't ask you to forgive me.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.880
And I don't deserve to forgive you.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.170
What?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.500
<i>Where did they go?!</i>

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:58.590
What is this?

00:11:58.710 --> 00:11:59.880
<i>Where's the evil one?!</i>

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.380
I think it's Nanashi's memories.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:09.140
Are you all right?
We'll be safe once across this mountain.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:13.400
Please think of
a name for our child by then.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.800
Forgive me, Father!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.200
Do what you will with me.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:26.180
But please spare her!

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:29.660
Never! You've committed sacrilege!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.690
You two should never be together!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:36.190
Father, is it a sin to love?!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.750
It's a sin!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:41.130
Please, at least until our child is born!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.650
I beg of you!

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.510
A <i>yokai</i> joined with a human?!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:48.640
My own daughter is tainted!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.310
Get them!

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.480
After them!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.060
Kill them!

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:09.120
This is from when
humans and <i>yokai</i> still coexisted.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.860
<i>Leave not a single one alive!</i>

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.490
<i>I wish he'd die.</i>

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.280
<i>That ugly thing.</i>

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.160
<i>I wish they'd all die.</i>

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:51.120
<i>Kill them!</i>

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:05.550
From the moment he was born,
he really had no name.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:10.300
Given love from no one
and bathed in nothing but hate.

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.730
That woman looked just like me.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.940
Nanashi's mother.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.410
I have to stop Nanashi.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.830
I'll help you!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.560
No! It's too dangerous!

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:47.840
I was made a vessel and
annihilated Cat-san... Stopping Nanashi...

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.950
is my purpose as well!

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:54.060
It's all right.

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.330
I have you, Kitaro.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:00.330
I trust you... I trust the <i>yokai</i>!

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:29.780
Finger Guns!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.870
Let's go!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.600
Okay!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:48.570
I wonder why Nanashi
chose me to be a vessel.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:53.590
Dad said you might have
some relation to Nanashi.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.890
I'm related to that person?

00:15:57.160 --> 00:16:01.640
You might be
a distant, distant descendant.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.150
Wally Wall!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:08.260
I bet Nanashi's been
watching your bloodline the whole time.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.650
Waiting for someone who could be a vessel.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:15.510
So I, a member of that bloodline,
met you, a <i>yokai</i>.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:19.950
Right. Just like
Nanashi's father and mother met.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.460
Everyone, this way!

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:27.150
My name was given to me
by my great-grandmother, a worshipper.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.210
It's all right now!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:34.720
In kanji, it's written as "true name".
Pronounced "Mana".

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.620
MANA

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:37.470
Mana and Nanashi...

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.980
I know what I have to do now.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:47.460
All right.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.220
Hurry!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.510
Run quickly!

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.600
This way!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.310
Hurry!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.480
That's it.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:11.760
Yeah.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.120
You hate the world.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.790
But did you know?

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:30.270
The opposite of love isn't hate.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:33.090
The opposite of love is indifference.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.470
You hate both humans and <i>yokai</i>.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:42.160
You may not realize it, but that's because
you want to be loved by both.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.690
Thank you for being born.

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:25.080
Your name is...

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.420
Kitaro.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.950
D... Dad?

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.230
Dad!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.380
Thank you, Mana-chan.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.240
I saw everything from inside Nanashi.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:05.160
This is thanks to you
giving Nanashi a name, Mana-chan.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.140
Kitaro!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.270
Rat Man.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.040
Where's everyone?

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.840
I dunno. Maybe they all died.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.520
Are you asking for a kiss from me?

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.010
Don't go killin' us off like that!

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.530
We're all okay!

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:25.140
Wally Wall!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.270
Cat-san...

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:06.280
Could you come to the forest?

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:18.650
Mana-chan, look over there.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.830
That's...

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:39.170
We went to the underworld and asked
Enma-Daio to let us bring her back.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.610
Catchick, come here.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.970
Cat-san?

00:21:48.260 --> 00:21:50.260
Mana-chan!

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:52.810
Wh...

00:21:53.980 --> 00:21:55.020
Wh...

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:59.610
What?!

